WEBVTT

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:35.840
We've got big news
in Beyblade today.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:39.890
Yesterday, Mr. Kogoro
Daitenji from the BBA

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:42.330
has been dismissed from
his position as chairman.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.810
What?!

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:48.900
The BBA will change its title and focus on the promotion

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.700
of Beyblade as a
professional sport.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:52.580
Goodness...

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:54.690
A pro league...

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.460
This is huge!

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.680
Good morning!

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.840
Takao!

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.970
Did you hear
today's news?

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.740
Yeah, I just found out.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:21.930
Just now?

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:26.530
So you haven't been
told anything, Takao?

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:29.240
All I know is that
I can't sit here.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.860
I don't know what's going on,
but let's go check it out.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.860
Our BBA headquarters!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.610
Good idea.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:36.540
Takao!

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:37.800
Wait for us!

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.330
What's goin' on?

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:44.130
It's kind of...
Showy...

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:47.300
What's going on
with BBA HQ?

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.600
Hey, Max!

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:52.240
Guys!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.400
Takao!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.050
So you're here too, Max?

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.100
Daichi!

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:01.570
Hey.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.180
Don't "hey!" me!

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.900
Why are you with Max?

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.610
Shaddap!
It's none of your business!

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.260
Come again?!

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.940
I'll explain later.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:15.080
For now we should...

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:18.050
Yeah!
What happened to the BBA?!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.920
What the heck's happening?!

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:41.520
No... And to think we were
just practicing there earlier.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:44.690
But why?!
It's so sudden!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:47.900
I don't have
the faintest clue.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:52.040
Dang! We can't
even get close!

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.570
Well?

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:03.440
No dice. I can't get in contact
with Daitenji, or even Hitoshi.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.610
Aww...

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:09.060
For now we should
gather information.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.600
A huge hit to Beyblading...

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.080
Daitenji is out and the BBA is hit with a coup d'etat, it says.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:19.120
A new stock market listing
as soon as next week...

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:22.200
With a new commissioner who has sights set on a pro league?

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.980
Beyblading goes pro...

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.460
Thank you, thank you!

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:48.370
The idea of a Beyblade pro
league sounds really great, but...

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.300
But man...

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.690
Either way, this isn't good...

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.720
Yeah. This is huge.

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:01.640
Go, Dragoon!

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:04.290
Don't lose to him,
Gaia Dragoon!

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:07.130
--Go, go!
--That's it!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.200
It's already been a week...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.420
There's still no new
valuable info out.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:17.330
On the topic of Beyblade,

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:22.740
There are no announcements from the new
management on rumors of a pro league.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:27.920
Here is the new song from everyone's
favorite up and coming star, Ming-Ming!

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:38.700
Oh, no! This has nothing
to do with Beyblade!

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:42.450
I wonder what's
up with the BBA...

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:46.420
I can't get into
battling like this.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.060
Let's go home, Daichi.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:50.140
Where's home?

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:52.260
My house!

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:55.570
Grandpa's worried about you!

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:59.480
I like Sensei's place better!

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.800
Sensei?

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.260
Suit yourself.

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:10.610
How long is
this going to last?

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:17.000
Some Bladers are already accepting
the idea of a pro league as fact...

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:20.340
This chick's everywhere.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:22.500
There's no end to it.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.660
She's really popular.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:30.020
It shouldn't be on the Beyblade segment of Sports News, right?

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:33.500
Ming-Ming's as
cute as a button!

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:41.380
That's just what I hear
from people! In general...

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:45.770
It's getting dark
so let's go home!

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:46.920
Sure.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.300
Wait, is that...

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.580
No way.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.480
Daitenji!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.130
Chairman!

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.410
Wait!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:12.020
Why are you running, Chairman?

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.320
Goodness...

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:27.120
You're not going
anywhere, Daitenji.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:30.500
Good to see you all...

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:36.580
I'm ashamed of myself.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:40.340
I don't have the
right to face you.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:44.360
Give it to us straight, pops!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.650
What happened to the BBA?

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.400
The truth is...

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.890
Soon after the
world championships,

00:07:53.890 --> 00:08:00.750
I got a request from a certain individual.
To purchase the BBA outright.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.540
And you sold it?

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.300
You're kidding me! The BBA...

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.180
...And our battles
aren't for sale!

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.200
Well, yes, but...

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.970
Mr. Daitenji knows that
more than anyone.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.650
Watch what you say, Takao.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.380
But...

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:26.160
Don't forget that the BBA
is composed of many people.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:32.690
The bigger the company, the more likely it is
that things will happen outside of your control.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:36.200
That's exactly it.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.500
The BBA does not
belong to me alone.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.940
I started it with with the support and assistance of many people.

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.810
In short, it is
those people who--

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:52.380
They agreed to sell
the BBA, then?

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:56.100
Yes. There may
have been a ploy to

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.820
increase the value of the company during the world championships.

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:04.100
So while you were focused
on the tournament...

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:06.500
It's as if they planned
to turn against you.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.980
Damn! How dare they.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:12.880
The new management
is shrouded in mystery.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:16.900
But I know that they will
hold a press conference...

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:22.130
to promote the launch
of the new management.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.100
A press conference?

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.520
I'm sure that's when
that man will show himself.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:31.740
That man... Is he the guy who
stole the BBA from us?

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.810
Who the hell is he?

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:36.800
Well...

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:44.290
Seeing is believing, is it not?
I think you should see for yourself.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.930
For ourselves?

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:01.100
Wow! It's packed!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:04.130
They've got
everyone's attention.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:07.600
Crap!
I can't see a thing!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.810
Takao! Look over there!

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.260
Is it time?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.840
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.770
Sorry for the wait!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:29.760
We will now start the press conference for the launch of the Beyblade Entertainment Global Association--

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.080
or BEGA for short!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.080
Isn't that...

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.900
Blader DJ?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.800
He really does show up
whenever Beyblade is involved.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:46.520
Dangit! I can't see!

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:50.200
Time to unveil the
new headquarters!

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:53.650
Feast your eyes!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.440
Talk about fancy!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:22.240
If they're trying to go pro, I guess they need a flair for the dramatic.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.280
Hey you!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:28.200
What the point of all this?

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:34.540
We're going to have
this girl kick things off!

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:46.170
Hey there, boys and girls!

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:48.840
Listen to my song!

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.580
It's Ming-Ming!
She's super popular!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.900
What's she doing here?

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.480
Get the camera on her!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:39.530
Ming-Ming's singing
right in front of us!

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.320
What's got you
so happy, Kyoujyu?

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:48.890
I just don't get it! What the hell kinda press conference is this?!

00:12:48.890 --> 00:12:52.200
What does this have
to do with Beyblade?!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.220
We have confirmed
Takao Kinomiya's presence.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.970
Right on schedule.

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:22.130
I hope this isn't too
much of a surprise,

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:28.420
but I'm the mascot for
the newly announced BEGA!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.930
Mascot?

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:37.050
Is that why she was on the
Beyblade segment of Sports News?

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:41.680
But we've got more
surprising special guests here!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:45.010
Welcome, former BBA members!

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.180
--What?!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.420
Here I go!

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.340
Bang!

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.850
Go, Shoot!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.080
What?

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.000
You're not just a pop idol.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.420
Cat's out of the bag, huh?

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:34.580
Yup. And I am...

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:38.880
BEGA pro Beyblader #1!

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:42.970
Whoa! Ming-Ming's the
first pro Beyblader?!

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:47.930
A singing, dancing pro Blader has
confronted the world champion!

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:50.100
Cameras on her!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:55.440
Pretty sloppy for an organization
that managed to kick out Daitenji.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:59.440
This prima donna pop star is supposed to be a pro? Now that's a laugh!

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:06.210
A pro has to be able to keep the audience entertained!

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:10.300
The fact that the champion doesn't get
something so basic makes Ming-Ming sad.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.520
What?!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:14.940
It's all about
standing out, isn't it?

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:20.380
If you wanna stand out you
do in an awesome battle!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:22.610
That's what makes
a real Blader!

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.800
You have a point...

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.000
Right?!

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.410
That's what it was
like under the BBA.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.530
That was good enough
in the old days.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:36.320
But unfortunately,
BBA is, well...

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:47.420
Under BEGA, Beyblade is going to evolve into a stylish, top class form of sports entertainment.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:51.640
You sweaty interlopers
have no place here.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.370
Sweaty interlopers?!

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.890
She really pisses me off...

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.940
I'm not gonna take
this sitting down!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.540
Listen up!
Beyblade is about...

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:06.960
Bladers duking it out
with their best attacks!

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.680
It's a sport fought
from the soul!

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:14.460
He's right! Don't make fun
of the battles we've fought!

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:17.030
Whoopsie, did I hit a nerve?

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.720
You sure did!
Who cares about style?

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:24.170
I don't approve of it!
If you want me to...

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.880
Then let's battle with these!

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:30.410
That's the only way to
cool down a hothead...

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:37.010
How 'bout it? We won't lose to some rag-tag fake "pros"!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.380
Fake, huh?

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:44.740
If that's how you're going to talk, I can't help but accept.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:47.050
Bring it!

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.330
Don't get hasty, now.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:52.100
If you want to
battle with me...

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:55.250
Do it after you've beaten
my Ming-Ming band!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:03.450
That's...

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.730
Hey, Daichi!

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:06.340
You got it, Sensei!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:14.160
Don't cry when you lose!

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.330
Right back at you!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.740
Let's do it! Go, Shoot!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:35.200
A special match has begun
where you'd least expect it!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.100
In which case...

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:44.200
A team battle between the new BEGA league and the current champions!

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.530
Who's got the
skill to go pro?

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:51.420
Show us an awesome battle!

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:56.200
Time for the Ming-Ming
band to strut their stuff!

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:58.620
Come on! One, two!

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:01.040
One, two, three, four!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.330
What?

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.130
What?!

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:28.290
It's like the Beyblades
are dancing with the music!

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:38.560
We're rocking out!
Make sure you have fun and keep dancing!

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:39.810
Yay!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.010
What is her deal?

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.040
What's fun about this?

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:50.450
Someone's gotta do something
about all that racket!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:52.010
Calm down, Daichi!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:55.220
You need to listen
to their performance!

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:05.540
You're right! It looks like their
moves are hard to predict at first.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:09.680
Yup. Once you get the rhythm,
their patterns are pretty simple.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:13.620
It was like their Beys
were moving at random.

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.640
Their attacks are
pretty weak, actually.

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:19.940
If this isn't fake,
I don't know what is!

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:22.320
Whoopsie.
Did they figure it out?

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:24.000
So with that in mind...

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.360
Do it, Max!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.850
Yeah. Okay, Takao!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:32.440
Whoa! Is Draciel
breaking formation?!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:36.780
It's leaving its team
to charge straight in!

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:41.300
Go! Gravity Control!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:52.120
No! It used its special
move to stop all their Beys!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.970
Now! Here we go, Daichi!

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.820
Aww yeah!

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.980
Take this! This is our power!

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:02.400
After surviving all
those intense battles!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.800
Whoopsie...

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:14.960
Piece of cake!

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:18.690
The current champs take the win!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:24.080
This is proof of their long
lasting friendship with Max!

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:29.080
Now it's your
turn, pro #1!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:32.250
No~!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:36.400
I never said
I'd battle you!

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:37.900
Oh, please...

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.580
No, seriously,
she pisses me off.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:44.690
You never fail to
impress, Kinomiya.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:50.180
I apologize for the rude behavior, so I do hope you'll forgive me.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:57.610
No! It can't be!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.940
She didn't mean
any harm, either.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:06.080
Seeing you simply lit
a fire in her Beyspirit.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:08.160
I'm truly sorry.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:15.300
No way! You're the one
who bought out the BBA...

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:19.610
I'm sorry to say,
but the BBA is no more.

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:24.290
But we at BEGA will
accept you with open arms.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.920
Kinomiya.

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:29.370
Why is Volkov here?!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:33.100
Darn! I just don't get it!

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:00.080
No way!
Volkov took over the BBA?

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:02.960
Hey, Volkov!
What are you planning?

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:05.490
Calm down, Takao!
They all look fine!

00:23:05.490 --> 00:23:08.460
No way! He's bad!

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:11.050
I'm going to kick this
villain's sorry butt!

00:23:11.050 --> 00:23:13.860
No! Volkov is not
an evil man!

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:16.090
I will not allow you to speak
of my savior like that!

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:19.250
Hey, you!
Apologize to Volkov!

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:21.930
Huh? Wait, who are you?
